class.description:
Describes size, position, [StyleBox]es, fill direction and follow behavior of bars created with [method ProgressBarServer.bar_create]. Many bars share one style; changing the style (or one of its [StyleBox]es) emits [signal Resource.changed] and redraws every bar that uses it.
Save a style as a [code].tres[/code] file to edit it in the Inspector and share it between unit types.
[codeblocks]
[gdscript]
var style = ProgressBarStyle.new()
style.size = Vector2(40, 5)
style.offset = Vector2(0, -32)
var fill = StyleBoxFlat.new()
fill.bg_color = Color.GREEN
style.fill = fill
style.follow_mode = ProgressBarStyle.FOLLOW_MODE_POSITION_ONLY
[/gdscript]
[csharp]
var style = new ProgressBarStyle();
style.Size = new Vector2(40, 5);
style.Offset = new Vector2(0, -32);
var fill = new StyleBoxFlat();
fill.BgColor = Colors.Green;
style.Fill = fill;
style.FollowMode = ProgressBarStyle.FollowModeEnum.PositionOnly;
[/csharp]
[/codeblocks]
